</Positioned>
<Positioned left="40" top="700" width="1320" height="268">
<Container width="1320" height="268" color="#111A2EFF" borderRadius="20">
<Stack fit="EXPAND">
<Positioned left="28" top="18" width="300" height="19">
<Text color="#F0F7FFFF" fontSize="13.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD" letterSpacing="1.4" text="实测边界" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="28" top="46" width="1264" height="1">
<Container color="#1B2E44FF" width="1264" height="1" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="28" top="62" width="10" height="10">
<Container color="#67E8F9FF" borderRadius="2.0" width="10" height="10" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="60" width="200" height="18">
<Text color="#FCD34DFF" fontSize="12.0" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans Mono" text="ImageFiltered" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="80" width="580" height="32">
<Text color="#9FBBD4FF" fontSize="11.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="糊自己的整棵子树。要「只糊背景」就不能用它包文字；而且它会按 sigma 自动扩大输出边界，模糊会溢出子节点的盒子。" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="660" top="62" width="10" height="10">
<Container color="#67E8F9FF" borderRadius="2.0" width="10" height="10" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="680" top="60" width="200" height="18">
<Text color="#FCD34DFF" fontSize="12.0" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans Mono" text="BackdropFilter" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="680" top="80" width="580" height="32">
<Text color="#9FBBD4FF" fontSize="11.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="读取「同一个绘制顺序里已经画过」的像素。所以它对之后才画的兄弟节点无效（探针 D：先 BF 再画条纹，条纹是锐的）。" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="28" top="136" width="10" height="10">
<Container color="#67E8F9FF" borderRadius="2.0" width="10" height="10" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="134" width="200" height="18">
<Text color="#FCD34DFF" fontSize="12.0" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans Mono" text="两者叠加" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="154" width="580" height="32">
<Text color="#9FBBD4FF" fontSize="11.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="先把背景放进 ImageFiltered，再把 BackdropFilter 作为后面的兄弟节点盖上去 —— 探针 E 证明这样 BF 采到的就是已模糊的像素（探针 C 的正确做法）。" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="660" top="136" width="10" height="10">
<Container color="#67E8F9FF" borderRadius="2.0" width="10" height="10" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="680" top="134" width="200" height="18">
<Text color="#FCD34DFF" fontSize="12.0" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans Mono" text="只能高斯" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="680" top="154" width="580" height="16">
<Text color="#9FBBD4FF" fontSize="11.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="这两个标签在 Parser 里只构造高斯模糊，没有 offset/tile/blur 之类（那是 Kotlin DSL 的 ImageFiltered）。" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="28" top="214" width="1264" height="16">
<Text color="#6B8AA5FF" fontSize="11.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="演示数据：机场、航班、跑道、天气报文均为自拟，不对应任何真实航班或气象报文；雷达回波是四个高斯团块的合成。" />
</Positioned>
</Stack>
</Container>
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="40" top="980" width="1200" height="17">
<Text color="#6B8AA5FF" fontSize="11.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="这套页面里唯一必须锐的是读数，其余都可以糊；这就是BackdropFilter 相对 ImageFiltered 的全部意义。" />
</Positioned>
</Stack>
</Container>
</Container>
</Snapshot>
